DESCRIPTION:Duration: 2h 12m (132 mins)\n\nEmilia Pérez follows four rema
 rkable women in Mexico\, each pursuing their own happiness. Cartel leader 
 Emilia enlists Rita\, an unappreciated lawyer\, to help fake her death so 
 that she can finally live authentically as her true self.\n\nhttps://www.i
 mdb.com/title/tt20221436/\n\nIMDb rating: 6.8
LOCATION:Landmark Crest Cinema\, Shoreline\, 16505 Fifth Avenue NE\, Shore
 line\, WA\, 98155
END:VEVENT
